{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Ominous Stew</strong>, the chaotic 1vs1 cooking battle game that pits legendary chefs against each other in fast-paced culinary duels! Dive into the chaos in Story Mode or challenge friends in Versus Mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409430/extras/8e81c4e9233a96f602816c78b4cfac30.avif?t=1768810609\" width=616 height=251 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409430/extras/9151a5296ad9e543012e50c3244ea3a9.avif?t=1768810609\" width=617 height=91 /></span>In Ominous Stew, it's restaurant vs. restaurant in thrilling 3-7 minute rounds. Move swiftly between customers to cook and serve dishes, aiming to outscore your opponent and claim culinary supremacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409430/extras/c59f44cd9be7ea8241d6738994ccd2cc.avif?t=1768810609\" width=617 height=91 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409430/extras/983339568eae4e660ddff34785f50d6c.poster.avif?t=1768810609\" width=616 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409430/extras/983339568eae4e660ddff34785f50d6c.webm?t=1768810609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409430/extras/983339568eae4e660ddff34785f50d6c.mp4?t=1768810609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Experience the freedom of cooking without recipes! Combine a variety of ingredients based on your customers' nutritional needs. Create unique dishes to earn points and prove your problem solving skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409430/extras/158b6f5c757d57bf9d0025c6e85b4f09.avif?t=1768810609\" width=617 height=91 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409430/extras/361e7be26eecd67db6c2dcdcbe9c0509.poster.avif?t=1768810609\" width=616 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409430/extras/361e7be26eecd67db6c2dcdcbe9c0509.webm?t=1768810609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409430/extras/361e7be26eecd67db6c2dcdcbe9c0509.mp4?t=1768810609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Unlock the full roster of chefs, each with their own restaurant and unique movement abilities. From simple Dashes to Table Riding - every character has a different playstyle with a learning curve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409430/extras/bc4ee5a4c1622b558de1df80e377febb.avif?t=1768810609\" width=617 height=91 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409430/extras/f63903b29cc381bb53c5af8594cf910b.poster.avif?t=1768810609\" width=616 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409430/extras/f63903b29cc381bb53c5af8594cf910b.webm?t=1768810609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409430/extras/f63903b29cc381bb53c5af8594cf910b.mp4?t=1768810609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Accumulate Foodji points by perfecting dishes, then unleash devastating attacks to sabotage your opponent. Strategic use of these powers can turn the tide of battle in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409430/extras/47f7783cd68b5639d8bb9e0faaccd54b.avif?t=1768810609\" width=617 height=91 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409430/extras/c9b0662688f273c1d52deeee52454149.poster.avif?t=1768810609\" width=616 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409430/extras/c9b0662688f273c1d52deeee52454149.webm?t=1768810609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409430/extras/c9b0662688f273c1d52deeee52454149.mp4?t=1768810609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Follow Stewy's journey from novice to culinary legend. Overcome challenges, unlock characters, attacks, bonus levels, nutrients and ingredients. Enjoy humorous dialogues and adjustable difficulty settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409430/extras/74efbdcc82e4569b3ec1a3154203e8af.avif?t=1768810609\" width=617 height=91 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409430/extras/8cb0bd519695169bd36d7e0966461fba.poster.avif?t=1768810609\" width=616 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409430/extras/8cb0bd519695169bd36d7e0966461fba.webm?t=1768810609\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2409430/extras/8cb0bd519695169bd36d7e0966461fba.mp4?t=1768810609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Compete with friends in local splitscreen or online. Select your characters, attacks, and ingredient sets to prove who\u2019s the top chef in head-to-head battles.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Adventurer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2409430/251d060f3ef9c6d26da7cb255f0d19fc831fa88c.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2409430/5c366aca232fcd3a93e1a7a49a7126020c6db366.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2409430/6f46ea357e80f679b911b423fc53b81dcb75ebb7.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2409430/38fbe928f5cf35add7e67941beff6cb2714d1a9b.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter 4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2409430/90cab703aa1119a00b50b8337e6143fe2624be58.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter 5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2409430/ba002e7743a8c02d6d125a51ad1e7a9365e727df.jpg"},{"name":"Versus Enjoyer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2409430/d4c3075b924294723b27b44e88cbefbf765d2285.jpg"},{"name":"You know, I'm something of a scientist myself","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2409430/190a8e4184723e7314c08e6c59965f3472faa896.jpg"},{"name":"Ominous Stew","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2409430/ae8e7c596378deb5740e5916012950a2f628900e.jpg"},{"name":"Perfect Stew","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2409